{"generated": "2026-07-28 12:29", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자 여러분,\n\n지난 24시간 동안 시장은 국내외적으로 큰 변동성을 보였습니다. 주요 이슈들을 중심으로 핵심 테마를 정리해 드립니다.\n\n<b>1. 국내 증시의 급락과 반도체 쇼크</b>\n코스피는 6,100선이 붕괴되고 8%대 급락을 기록하며 서킷브레이커가 발동되는 등 극심한 하락세를 보였습니다. 이는 올해 들어 8번째 서킷브레이커 발동이며, 특히 반도체 업황에 대한 우려와 중국발 반도체 쇼크가 주요 원인으로 지목됩니다. 삼성전자와 SK하이닉스 등 주요 반도체 기업 주가가 폭락하며 국내 증시 전반에 패닉을 불러왔습니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9ZWk52RWpHcVUxTTZKY1l4aVFseUJ5SWxHZXdJNWJIandqdzFDQXJZS0JXNkhHR1AzTlRtQW5KVWIySWxLcFZMT0xIS1dILWFi?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#1</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE0xTGx6cl93UDBYU2xrcDZMSzEtZXBHVm9rWFAwazBzX2hrUnpGaXlqa0l5Znp4SGRBbVpONmNjQTVvQldQSzZfVVo4VDdic0tiLThJcnJPVjFBUUxBOHdTalRNaGpoZi1NckRLdnNfRUtWY2F0d2hZZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBUNGw2LW9WbHEtTG9lZklBRU9mN2RXTWFaRVNWMGNlWDdvVENPR0MtdzllMnlUY0FyM3FTY1puYmc4U0pvUnVSQmh6NDhWOGdWODFTb052SjhEeTFMQXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#4</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#12</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE5FYjVhTnZ1SGhKbzFhaUdGZlg0dExYZXYxc2dlZ0dKeDdRYnpOZFdibUJnU3JyRU5UWS1MVUlia0l3QjVrTktQejhxV2xRXzBVSm9WZnZhYWU2OEx1UXJrWjRZWDNPb1FLN04zODlJbw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1qakx6d2tPYlVQX0RTamxyS0pmSlNuSklYaUk0VDltdDFKRVM5U3g3aWY1OFZnX0VGbmRYRFk2VHRHYmhKcDM2WkhmNHBNTG9WTmc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5nU0pqWUdjMFIwRi1jX3BOSHFRczRKdE1yQlJ0Wkt0dUhkamhOUEx4TWMyeHBIc3lvSFotZ2g0RjVmT01lZ0JDNExfZGRuWVl0VGxjNkFSak04R0p3TmhiZldydHl5RU5PdVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE12bmVNU2JGZHNyZUVqTHBteVlvelZfeS1nWjFybkxjUHBydTBScktXcXdTaDFRY3RoSFo4NVlRMldQSzVKaDdGb